{"id":"ccbc12:problem:a-p2024","answer":"GLOBAL COMMUNITY","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>既然是买了新iPad之后再打出来的字，那研究一下iPad默认（英文）键盘上有什么符号和字母的对应吧。</p>","text":"既然是买了新iPad之后再打出来的字，那研究一下iPad默认（英文）键盘上有什么符号和字母的对应吧。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>网上搜索iPad英文键盘，可以发现英文键盘上每个字母都对应一个符号：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-5cf304baf300ad94911ae6ad\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/a-2024.jpg\"/></p>\n<p>把题目中的符号转换回字母得到答案：<strong>GLOBAL COMMUNITY</strong>。</p>","text":"网上搜索iPad英文键盘，可以发现英文键盘上每个字母都对应一个符号：\n\n把题目中的符号转换回字母得到答案：\nGLOBAL COMMUNITY\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-5cf304baf300ad94911ae6ad"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-5cf304baf300ad94911ae6ad","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/a-2024.jpg","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/a-2024.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":32574,"sha256":"b685f439a9ebb860f03a13147211c785a77b3441b2069a9a3be3be8a5a039542","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
